   103→ * ArrowAnnotation Component
   104→ *
   105→ * Renders a directional arrow between two points on the 3D field.
   106→ * The arrow consists of a line segment with a cone arrowhead at the end point.
   107→ * Supports selection highlighting with visual indicator.
   108→ * When selected, both endpoints can be dragged to new positions.
